      "id": "packages/ai/package.json",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "package.json",
      "description": "@earendil-works/pi-ai 包配置文件。定义包名、版本(0.84.1)、ESM 模块导出(main/exports)、CLI 二进制入口、构建脚本(vitest 测试、tsgo 编译、模型目录生成)、核心依赖(@anthropic-ai/sdk, @google/genai, openai, @aws-sdk/client-bedrock-runtime 等)及开发依赖。",
      "fileCategory": "config",
      "language": "json",
      "sizeLines": 100,
      "metadata": {
        "packageName": "@earendil-works/pi-ai",
        "version": "0.84.1",
        "moduleType": "ESM",
        "dependencies": [
          "@anthropic-ai/sdk",
          "@aws-sdk/client-bedrock-runtime",
          "@earendil-works/pi-telemetry",
          "@google/genai",
          "@opentelemetry/api",
          "@smithy/node-http-handler",
          "http-proxy-agent",
          "https-proxy-agent",
          "openai",
          "partial-json",
          "typebox"
        ],
        "devDependencies": ["@types/node", "canvas", "vitest"],
        "exports": [".", "./compat", "./providers/*", "./api/*", "./oauth", "./bedrock-provider", "./bun-oauth"],
        "engines": { "node": ">=22.19.0" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/ai/tsconfig.build.json",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "tsconfig.build.json",
      "description": "@earendil-works/pi-ai 包的 TypeScript 构建配置。继承基础 tsconfig.base.json，配置输出目录(dist)、源码根目录(src)、模块系统(NodeNext)及包含/排除规则。",
      "fileCategory": "config",
      "language": "json",
      "sizeLines": 10,
      "metadata": {
        "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
        "compilerOptions": {
          "outDir": "./dist",
          "rootDir": "./src",
          "module": "NodeNext",
          "moduleResolution": "NodeNext"
        },
        "include": ["src/**/*.ts"],
        "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist", "**/*.d.ts", "src/**/*.d.ts"]
      }
